      "locked": false,
      "id": "rulest",
      "roundness": null,
      "type": "text",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rules",
      "originalText": "Two rules that explain the layout\n\n1. A component never touches Dexie.\n     It calls a store; the store calls core/storage.\n\n2. A component never calls fetch.\n     The send path is store → connector.\n\nNearly every \"where does this go?\" question\nfalls out of these two.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "x": 1088,
      "y": 312.5,
      "width": 384,
      "height": 175,
      "text": "Two rules that explain the layout\n\n1. A component never touches Dexie.\n     It calls a store; the store calls core/storage.\n\n2. A component never calls fetch.\n     The send path is store → connector.\n\nNearly every \"where does this go?\" question\nfalls out of these two."
    },
